  "answer": "**答案：** 1875 年，George Brown 拒绝出任安大略省副总督（Lieutenant Governor of Ontario）。\n\n只搜了 1 次。搜索结果把这件事放在 1875 年。他拒绝爵位是另一回事，资料记在 1879 年，不是 1875 年。我没有直接打开网页核对原文。\n\n依据：\n- [The Canadian Encyclopedia – George Brown](https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/george-brown)\n- [Parks Canada – George Brown House National Historic Site](https://parks.canada.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house)\n- [1911 Encyclopædia Britannica – Brown, George](https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/1911_Encyclop%C3%A6dia_Britannica/Brown,_George)",
